WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.738
Grain remains the central safety rule A CTE can have
a different

00:00:05.751 --> 00:00:11.434
grain from the source table A window function
usually preserves the current

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:17.069
row grain A later filter can reduce the number of
rows without changing

00:00:17.095 --> 00:00:22.792
what one row represents If you cannot explain the
row meaning at each stage

00:00:22.976 --> 00:00:26.029
advanced syntax can hide mistakes instead of solving
them
